The model
---------

**ettin-17m-nemotron-pii** (and the 32m / 68m sizes) — the detector that does
all of the actual work. Copyright Kalyan KS, 2026. **MIT licence.**
https://huggingface.co/kalyan-ks/ettin-17m-nemotron-pii

The ONNX graphs in `models/` are exports of those published weights, made by
`scripts/export-onnx.py` and otherwise unmodified. They are redistributed here
under the model's MIT licence, with its model card beside each export. The
model is built on the **Ettin encoders** (Johns Hopkins University CLSP, MIT)
and fine-tuned on **Nemotron-PII** (NVIDIA, CC BY 4.0). `models/README.md`
carries the full attribution, including the citation the authors ask for.

Everything in this repository and in a built `.rcx` is therefore under
