Software this extension is built on
-----------------------------------

A built `.rcx` is not source: it is a compiled shared library that statically
links its Rust dependencies — an ONNX inference engine (`tract`), a tokenizer
(`tokenizers`), an HTTP client (`ureq`), a hash (`sha2`) and a JSON codec
(`serde_json`), plus their transitive dependencies. Distributing one therefore
carries those crates' notice obligations. The complete set is reproduced in
THIRD-PARTY.txt, which is generated from the resolved dependency graph and
packaged inside every `.rcx`. See NOTICE for the short form.
